{"seq":2,"slug":"thermal-power-management","title":"热管理与功耗优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/engineering/thermal-power-management","wordCount":1273,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"热管理与功耗优化\">热管理与功耗优化</h1><p>iPhone 16 Pro 在连续运行端侧 LLM 推理时，仅两次迭代后吞吐便从 32 tok/s 暴跌到 17 tok/s——下降 47%。Galaxy S24 Ultra 更为激进，系统直接终止了 GPU 推理进程。这不是软件 bug，而是移动设备在 2-3W 持续功耗窗口内无法散去 NPU/GPU 全速运行产生的热量时，操作系统为保护硬件而实施的强制降频。热节流（Thermal Throttling）是端侧 ML 从「demo 能跑」到「产品能用」之间最大的工程鸿沟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>移动设备的热与功耗约束形成一个严格的物理边界：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[AI 推理负载] --&gt; B[芯片发热&lt;br/&gt;P = V² × f × C]&#10;    B --&gt; C{表面温度}&#10;    C --&gt;|&lt;40°C| D[全速运行&lt;br/&gt;Peak Performance]&#10;    C --&gt;|40-45°C| E[轻度降频&lt;br/&gt;Nominal Mode]&#10;    C --&gt;|&gt;45°C| F[严重降频&lt;br/&gt;Thermal Throttle]&#10;    C --&gt;|&gt;50°C| G[强制暂停&lt;br/&gt;Critical Shutdown]&#10;    F --&gt; H[性能下降 30-70%]&#10;    G --&gt; I[推理中断]\">graph TD\n    A[AI 推理负载] --&gt; B[芯片发热&lt;br/&gt;P = V² × f × C]\n    B --&gt; C{表面温度}\n    C --&gt;|&lt;40°C| D[全速运行&lt;br/&gt;Peak Performance]\n    C --&gt;|40-45°C| E[轻度降频&lt;br/&gt;Nominal Mode]\n    C --&gt;|&gt;45°C| F[严重降频&lt;br/&gt;Thermal Throttle]\n    C --&gt;|&gt;50°C| G[强制暂停&lt;br/&gt;Critical Shutdown]\n    F --&gt; H[性能下降 30-70%]\n    G --&gt; I[推理中断]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束维度</th>\n<th>桌面/服务器</th>\n<th>移动设备</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续功耗 (TDP)</td>\n<td>65-350W</td>\n<td>2-5W</td>\n<td>算力天花板低 100 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>散热方式</td>\n<td>风扇/液冷</td>\n<td>被动散热</td>\n<td>热量只能通过外壳辐射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热容量</td>\n<td>大面积散热片</td>\n<td>薄 PCB + 石墨散热膜</td>\n<td>蓄热时间 &lt;30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降频策略</td>\n<td>渐进式</td>\n<td>阶梯式/断崖式</td>\n<td>性能突变不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户感知</td>\n<td>风扇噪音可接受</td>\n<td>烫手不可接受</td>\n<td>温度天花板更低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"功耗建模\">功耗建模</h2><h3 id=\"soc-功耗构成\">SoC 功耗构成</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>dynamic</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>static</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>leak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{total}} = P_{\\text{dynamic}} + P_{\\text{static}} = \\alpha C V^2 f + V I_{\\text{leak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dynamic</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">static</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是活动因子（activity factor），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是负载电容，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是供电电压，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是时钟频率。</p>\n<p>对于 AI 推理负载：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NPU 峰值功耗</strong>：3-5W（Apple ANE），4-7W（Qualcomm Hexagon 全速）</li>\n<li><strong>GPU ML 负载</strong>：2-4W</li>\n<li><strong>CPU 推理</strong>：1-2W（但速度最慢）</li>\n<li><strong>系统空闲功耗</strong>：0.3-0.5W</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"能效比对比\">能效比对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>执行设备</th>\n<th>典型功耗</th>\n<th>MobileNetV2 推理</th>\n<th>能效 (inferences/Joule)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU (A78)</td>\n<td>1.5W</td>\n<td>25ms</td>\n<td>26.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU (Metal)</td>\n<td>2.5W</td>\n<td>8ms</td>\n<td>50.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NPU (ANE)</td>\n<td>1.2W</td>\n<td>3.5ms</td>\n<td>238.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NPU (Hexagon)</td>\n<td>1.8W</td>\n<td>4ms</td>\n<td>138.9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NPU 的能效优势在短时推理中尤为明显（快速完成后立即进入低功耗状态），但<strong>持续推理</strong>时能效优势被热节流抵消。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热节流机制\">热节流机制</h2><h3 id=\"ios-热管理\">iOS 热管理</h3><p>Apple 通过 <code>ProcessInfo.ThermalState</code> 向 App 暴露设备热状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>推荐行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.nominal</code></td>\n<td>正常温度</td>\n<td>全速推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.fair</code></td>\n<td>轻微升温</td>\n<td>降低推理频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.serious</code></td>\n<td>显著升温</td>\n<td>切换小模型/暂停非必要推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.critical</code></td>\n<td>接近极限</td>\n<td>立即停止所有 ML 任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"android-热管理\">Android 热管理</h3><p>Android 通过 <code>PowerManager</code> 和 <code>ThermalService</code> 提供温度回调：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val thermalService = getSystemService(PowerManager::class.java)&#10;thermalService.addThermalStatusListener { status -&gt;&#10;    when (status) {&#10;        PowerManager.THERMAL_STATUS_MODERATE -&gt; reduceInferenceRate()&#10;        PowerManager.THERMAL_STATUS_SEVERE -&gt; switchToLightModel()&#10;        PowerManager.THERMAL_STATUS_CRITICAL -&gt; stopInference()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val thermalService = getSystemService(PowerManager::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>thermalService.addThermalStatusListener { status -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when (status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PowerManager.THERMAL_STATUS_MODERATE -> reduceInferenceRate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PowerManager.THERMAL_STATUS_SEVERE -> switchToLightModel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PowerManager.THERMAL_STATUS_CRITICAL -> stopInference()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"热节流的性能影响实测\">热节流的性能影响实测</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备</th>\n<th>初始性能</th>\n<th>10 次迭代后</th>\n<th>降幅</th>\n<th>恢复时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iPhone 16 Pro (LLM)</td>\n<td>32 tok/s</td>\n<td>17 tok/s</td>\n<td>-47%</td>\n<td>60-90s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Galaxy S24 Ultra (LLM)</td>\n<td>28 tok/s</td>\n<td>0 (终止)</td>\n<td>-100%</td>\n<td>120s+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pixel 10 (LLM)</td>\n<td>25 tok/s</td>\n<td>23 tok/s</td>\n<td>-8%</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iPhone 16 Pro (Vision)</td>\n<td>3.2ms</td>\n<td>4.8ms</td>\n<td>+50%</td>\n<td>30s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Pixel 10 的优异表现源于 Google 在 Tensor G5 上针对持续 AI 负载优化了散热设计（更大的散热面积 + 蒸气腔）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用层功耗优化策略\">应用层功耗优化策略</h2><h3 id=\"推理调度优化\">推理调度优化</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[推理请求] --&gt; B{热状态检查}&#10;    B --&gt;|nominal| C[全速推理&lt;br/&gt;NPU max clock]&#10;    B --&gt;|fair| D[降频推理&lt;br/&gt;插入 50ms 间隔]&#10;    B --&gt;|serious| E[切换轻量模型&lt;br/&gt;或批量合并请求]&#10;    B --&gt;|critical| F[暂停推理&lt;br/&gt;显示降级 UI]&#10;    C --&gt; G[结果]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H[等待冷却]\">flowchart TD\n    A[推理请求] --&gt; B{热状态检查}\n    B --&gt;|nominal| C[全速推理&lt;br/&gt;NPU max clock]\n    B --&gt;|fair| D[降频推理&lt;br/&gt;插入 50ms 间隔]\n    B --&gt;|serious| E[切换轻量模型&lt;br/&gt;或批量合并请求]\n    B --&gt;|critical| F[暂停推理&lt;br/&gt;显示降级 UI]\n    C --&gt; G[结果]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H[等待冷却]</pre><h3 id=\"间歇式推理-duty-cycling\">间歇式推理（Duty Cycling）</h3><p>不需要每帧/每秒都推理的场景（如场景分类、用户行为预测），可以采用间歇式执行：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推理 100ms → 休眠 200ms → 推理 100ms（占空比 33%）</li>\n<li>持续功耗从 3W 降至 1W，热节流风险大幅降低</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"模型级别的功耗控制\">模型级别的功耗控制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>功耗收益</th>\n<th>精度代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动态分辨率</td>\n<td>降低输入分辨率 (224→160)</td>\n<td>-40%</td>\n<td>-2-5% 精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Early Exit</td>\n<td>简单样本提前退出不执行后续层</td>\n<td>-30-50%</td>\n<td>取决于置信度阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型切换</td>\n<td>高温时切换到更小的模型</td>\n<td>-50-70%</td>\n<td>显著但可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批次合并</td>\n<td>积累多个请求一次推理</td>\n<td>-20-30%</td>\n<td>增加延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度降级</td>\n<td>从 INT8 切换到 INT4</td>\n<td>-20-30%</td>\n<td>-1-3%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"early-exit-机制\">Early Exit 机制</h3><p>在 Transformer 模型中，简单输入（高置信度样本）不需要经过全部层就能得到足够好的结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>exit</mtext></msub><mtext> at layer </mtext><mi>l</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> return output</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{if } \\max(\\text{softmax}(h_l)) &gt; \\theta_{\\text{exit}} \\text{ at layer } l: \\text{ return output}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> at layer </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> return output</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实测表明 40-60% 的输入可以在前 50% 的层就达到 95%+ 的置信度，显著降低平均功耗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电池影响评估\">电池影响评估</h2><h3 id=\"功耗测量工具\">功耗测量工具</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>iOS</strong>：Xcode Energy Organizer / Instruments Energy Log</li>\n<li><strong>Android</strong>：Android Battery Historian / <code>dumpsys batterystats</code></li>\n<li><strong>跨平台</strong>：外接功耗仪（Monsoon Power Monitor）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"用户可接受的功耗预算\">用户可接受的功耗预算</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>使用模式</th>\n<th>每小时电池消耗</th>\n<th>用户感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt;2% / hour</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n<td>理想状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-5% / hour</td>\n<td>轻微感知</td>\n<td>可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5-10% / hour</td>\n<td>明显感知</td>\n<td>需要优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;10% / hour</td>\n<td>用户投诉</td>\n<td>不可上线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 iPhone 16 Pro（3577 mAh / 13.6 Wh）为例，2%/hour = 272 mW 持续功耗——这意味着端侧 ML 功能的持续功耗预算约 250-300mW（扣除系统底噪后）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>移动设备的热管理是端侧 ML 最大的物理约束，2-3W TDP 限制了持续推理性能</li>\n<li>热节流是阶梯式/断崖式的，性能可能突然下降 50% 以上</li>\n<li>应用层必须监听热状态并主动调整推理策略（间歇/降频/换模型）</li>\n<li>NPU 在短时推理中能效极高（238 inf/J），但持续负载下优势被热节流抵消</li>\n<li>功耗预算目标：&lt;250mW 持续 = 用户无感知的电池影响</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"model-conversion-deployment\">模型转换与部署流水线</a> — 在部署管线中集成设备感知的模型变体选择</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization/power-consumption-optimization\">移动性能：功耗优化</a> — 通用移动应用的功耗优化方法论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热管理与功耗优化","id":"热管理与功耗优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"功耗建模","id":"功耗建模"},{"level":3,"text":"SoC 功耗构成","id":"soc-功耗构成"},{"level":3,"text":"能效比对比","id":"能效比对比"},{"level":2,"text":"热节流机制","id":"热节流机制"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 热管理","id":"ios-热管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 热管理","id":"android-热管理"},{"level":3,"text":"热节流的性能影响实测","id":"热节流的性能影响实测"},{"level":2,"text":"应用层功耗优化策略","id":"应用层功耗优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"推理调度优化","id":"推理调度优化"},{"level":3,"text":"间歇式推理（Duty Cycling）","id":"间歇式推理-duty-cycling"},{"level":3,"text":"模型级别的功耗控制","id":"模型级别的功耗控制"},{"level":3,"text":"Early Exit 机制","id":"early-exit-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"电池影响评估","id":"电池影响评估"},{"level":3,"text":"功耗测量工具","id":"功耗测量工具"},{"level":3,"text":"用户可接受的功耗预算","id":"用户可接受的功耗预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"模型转换与部署流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/engineering/model-conversion-deployment"},"next":{"title":"端云协同与混合推理架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/engineering/hybrid-edge-cloud"}}